{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":420,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"The Lord created mankind out of earth, and turned them back to it again.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1450},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":421,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"He gave them days by number, and a set time, and gave them authority over the things that are on it.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1453},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":422,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"He endowed them with strength proper to them, and made them according to his own image.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1456},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":423,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"He put the fear of man upon all flesh, and gave him dominion over beasts and birds.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1459},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":424,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"","is_omitted":1,"source_line":1461},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":425,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"He gave them counsel, tongue, eyes, ears, and heart to have understanding.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1463},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":426,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"He filled them with the knowledge of wisdom, and showed them good and evil.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1466},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":427,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"He set his eye upon their hearts, to show them the majesty of his works.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1469},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":428,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"","is_omitted":1,"source_line":1471},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":429,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"And they will praise his holy name, that they may declare the majesty of his works.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1473},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":430,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"He added to them knowledge, and gave them a law of life for a heritage.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1476},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":431,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"He made an everlasting covenant with them, and showed them his decrees.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1479},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":432,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"Their eyes saw the majesty of his glory. Their ears heard the glory of his voice.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1482},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":433,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"He said to them, “Beware of all unrighteousness.” So he gave them commandment, each man concerning his neighbor.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1485},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":434,"verse_start":15,"verse_end":15,"verse_label":"15","text":"Their ways are ever before him. They will not be hidden from his eyes.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1489},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":435,"verse_start":16,"verse_end":16,"verse_label":"16","text":"","is_omitted":1,"source_line":1491},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":436,"verse_start":17,"verse_end":17,"verse_label":"17","text":"For every nation he appointed a ruler, but Israel is the Lord’s portion.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1493},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":437,"verse_start":18,"verse_end":18,"verse_label":"18","text":"","is_omitted":1,"source_line":1495},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":438,"verse_start":19,"verse_end":19,"verse_label":"19","text":"All their works are as clear as the sun before him. His eyes are continually upon their ways.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1497},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":439,"verse_start":20,"verse_end":20,"verse_label":"20","text":"Their iniquities are not hidden from him. All their sins are before the Lord.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1500},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":440,"verse_start":21,"verse_end":21,"verse_label":"21","text":"","is_omitted":1,"source_line":1502},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":441,"verse_start":22,"verse_end":22,"verse_label":"22","text":"With him the alms of a man is as a signet. He will keep a man’s kindness as the pupil of the eye.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1504},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":442,"verse_start":23,"verse_end":23,"verse_label":"23","text":"Afterwards he will rise up and repay them, and give their repayment upon their head.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1507},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":443,"verse_start":24,"verse_end":24,"verse_label":"24","text":"However to those who repent he grants a return. He comforts those who are losing hope.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1510},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":444,"verse_start":25,"verse_end":25,"verse_label":"25","text":"Return to the Lord, and forsake sins. Make your prayer before his face offend less.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1514},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":445,"verse_start":26,"verse_end":26,"verse_label":"26","text":"Turn again to the Most High, and turn away from iniquity. Greatly hate the abominable thing.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1517},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":446,"verse_start":27,"verse_end":27,"verse_label":"27","text":"Who will give praise to the Most High in Hades, in place of the living who return thanks?","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1520},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":447,"verse_start":28,"verse_end":28,"verse_label":"28","text":"Thanksgiving perishes from the dead, as from one who doesn’t exist. He who is in life and health will praise the Lord.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1523},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":448,"verse_start":29,"verse_end":29,"verse_label":"29","text":"How great is the mercy of the Lord, and his forgiveness to those who turn to him!","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1526},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":449,"verse_start":30,"verse_end":30,"verse_label":"30","text":"For humans are not capable of everything, because the son of man is not immortal.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1529},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":450,"verse_start":31,"verse_end":31,"verse_label":"31","text":"What is brighter than the sun? Yet even this can be eclipsed. So flesh and blood devise evil.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1532},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:sir","chapter":17,"verse_ordinal":451,"verse_start":32,"verse_end":32,"verse_label":"32","text":"He looks upon the power of the height of heaven, while all men are earth and ashes.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1535}]}